  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Many users recently have been incorrectly thinking their package is \"up-to-date\" when it's really not after reformatting, because the Latest Version field shows the current version if a package is not found in any repository.\n\nIf a package is not found in any repository, there should be some warning or indication that the package cannot be updated because the repository is not available.",
